{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:27 2026-08-30 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:27 2026-08-30 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:27 2026-08-30 HKT</p><p>青衣有人墮海。今日（30日）早上11時36分，警方及消防接報，指在青衣橋近貨櫃碼頭對開海面，有一具人形物體載浮載沉。救援人員趕至搜救，其後救起一名年約50多歲男子，但發現他昏迷不醒。人員隨即將事主送抵青衣消防碼頭，再由救護車送往仁濟醫院搶救。事件原因有待調查。</p><img alt=\"救援人員在海面救起一名男子，將他送往消防碼頭，再轉送醫院。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8fcfc5f409881aa0bd8873119360c37b/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-30_at_12_15_14.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方調查事件。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/77bc23abd4634fcf8d398b9efb2f4207/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-30_at_12_15_13_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f2c7ad36a00a9de6d39325e9ddbf9021/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-30_at_12_15_13_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方和消防到場救援。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/69c2bb8d729a27ab5c474341ed502a76/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-30_at_12_15_13.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"墮海男子昏迷，由救護車送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/132382ca5e87166b66adcdd2b4510884/2026-08/1_1_27.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c65b318217fbd6637411cc2835973bd3/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-30_at_12_15_12_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防輪到場救援。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/7c8a7d677ef2db5fe6e68c9f4c5c8bad/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-30_at_12_15_12.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/32fbd30c31b0406b2dd061f22ab3f518/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-30_at_12_15_11.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T04:38:12.559944+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}